;; fixture — beancount-reconcile eval19 (split settlement: one statement row, two postings)
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-04-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking USD
2026-04-01 open Expenses:Travel:Lodging USD
2026-04-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-04-30 * "Opening deposit"
  Assets:Bank:Checking   1000.00 USD
  Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-05-01 balance Assets:Bank:Checking   1000.00 USD

2026-05-06 * "HOTEL MERIDIAN DEPOSIT"
  Assets:Bank:Checking    -30.00 USD
  Expenses:Travel:Lodging

2026-05-07 * "HOTEL MERIDIAN FINAL"
  Assets:Bank:Checking    -45.00 USD
  Expenses:Travel:Lodging
